>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GAMEPAGE-BUILDER.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT HTML-FILE ASSIGN TO "index.html"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT CSS-FILE ASSIGN TO "assets/styles.css"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT JS-FILE ASSIGN TO "assets/status.js"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT NOTFOUND-FILE ASSIGN TO "404.html"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT FAVICON-FILE ASSIGN TO "favicon.svg"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT ROBOTS-FILE ASSIGN TO "robots.txt"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.
    SELECT SECURITY-FILE ASSIGN TO "security.txt"
        ORGANIZATION IS LINE SEQUENTIAL.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD HTML-FILE.
01 HTML-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD CSS-FILE.
01 CSS-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD JS-FILE.
01 JS-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD NOTFOUND-FILE.
01 NOTFOUND-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD FAVICON-FILE.
01 FAVICON-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD ROBOTS-FILE.
01 ROBOTS-LINE PIC X(4096).
FD SECURITY-FILE.
01 SECURITY-LINE PIC X(4096).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    OPEN OUTPUT HTML-FILE CSS-FILE JS-FILE NOTFOUND-FILE
        FAVICON-FILE ROBOTS-FILE SECURITY-FILE
    PERFORM WRITE-HTML
    PERFORM WRITE-CSS
    PERFORM WRITE-JAVASCRIPT
    PERFORM WRITE-NOTFOUND
    PERFORM WRITE-FAVICON
    PERFORM WRITE-ROBOTS
    PERFORM WRITE-SECURITY
    CLOSE HTML-FILE CSS-FILE JS-FILE NOTFOUND-FILE
        FAVICON-FILE ROBOTS-FILE SECURITY-FILE
    DISPLAY "GamePage assets generated by GnuCOBOL."
    STOP RUN.

